    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMDCwYDr8gkM",
      "content": "And I'll confirm that I did talk to the leasing agent last week and she told me that I could move-in a day early if that was what the movers could handle.",
      "name": "Jinny Garberson",
      "time": "2026-09-16T22:17:05.110934",
