      "time": "2026-09-16T22:17:20.675177",
      "type": "transcript",
      "user_id": "4886812291923968"
    },
    {
      "content": "That is so nice of them to let you move-in earlier.",
      "name": "Jules Nicolas",
      "time": "2026-09-16T22:17:24.275177",
      "type": "transcript",
      "user_id": "4886812291923968"
    },
    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMDCwYDr8gkM",
      "content": "I thought so too. Yeah, I didn't expect that. So, and I was worried since I am waiting so long to, to book a mover, I don't know what was going on in my head and people kept calling me and, you know, so, I got, we talk to way too many people.",
