      "user_id": "4886812291923968"
    },
    {
      "content": "Oh, yeah, not all, not all apartment buildings do that. We have some issues with, you know, some of the customers, sometimes they don't even let the tenants move-in hours earlier just to fit in the schedule of the movers.",
